{
    "title": "Smart TV Remote for Samsung TV",
    "description": "Samsung Remote TV Smartthings is the perfect remote control for your Samsung Smart TV. The app is a fully functional remote control that gain you access to every Samsung TV features & applications, such as: Samsung Smartthings, Samsung Smartview. No need to look for the physical Samsung remote, just open the app, click & enjoy your screen time now.\r\n\r\nStreaming any photo, videos, apps and media contents has not been easier with Samsung Remote TV Smart Things, right from your device or internet to your Samsung Smart TV.\r\n\r\n<b>FEATURES</b>\r\n- Remote-control your Samsung smartthings TV\r\n- Casting Photos & Videos from your android phone to any Smartthings Samsung TV in the house.\r\n- Cast Media Files from Dropbox & Google Drive\r\n- Smart Mirror for Samsung smartthings TV \r\n- Search and cast your favorite music tracks and play it on your Smart things TV \r\n- Search and cast any media from the internet using the built-in browser\r\n- Smartthings TV photo slideshow casting\r\n- Easy media playing controls\r\n\r\nStop looking under your couch or bed for your lost remote. No need to worry  about forgetting to put new batteries for dead physical remote anymore.\r\n\r\nSamsung Remote TV Smartthings is the perfect solution of convenience, smart, and ease for your Samsung Smart TV\r\n\r\n<b>SETUP GUIDE:</b>\r\nPlease make sure your phone and Smart TV are connected to the same Wi-Fi network.\r\n\r\n<b>Disclaimer</b>\r\nThis app is not an official Samsung application. We are not affiliated with Samsung Electronics in any way.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Samsung Remote TV Smartthings is the perfect remote control for your Samsung Smart TV. The app is a fully functional remote control that gain you access to every Samsung TV features &amp; applications, such as: Samsung Smartthings, Samsung Smartview. No need to look for the physical Samsung remote, just open the app, click &amp; enjoy your screen time now.<br><br>Streaming any photo, videos, apps and media contents has not been easier with Samsung Remote TV Smart Things, right from your device or internet to your Samsung Smart TV.<br><br><b>FEATURES</b><br>- Remote-control your Samsung smartthings TV<br>- Casting Photos &amp; Videos from your android phone to any Smartthings Samsung TV in the house.<br>- Cast Media Files from Dropbox &amp; Google Drive<br>- Smart Mirror for Samsung smartthings TV <br>- Search and cast your favorite music tracks and play it on your Smart things TV <br>- Search and cast any media from the internet using the built-in browser<br>- Smartthings TV photo slideshow casting<br>- Easy media playing controls<br><br>Stop looking under your couch or bed for your lost remote. No need to worry  about forgetting to put new batteries for dead physical remote anymore.<br><br>Samsung Remote TV Smartthings is the perfect solution of convenience, smart, and ease for your Samsung Smart TV<br><br><b>SETUP GUIDE:</b><br>Please make sure your phone and Smart TV are connected to the same Wi-Fi network.<br><br><b>Disclaimer</b><br>This app is not an official Samsung application. We are not affiliated with Samsung Electronics in any way.",
